<view class="page">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">导出选项</view>
    <picker range="{{formats}}" value="{{formatIndex}}" bindchange="onFormatChange"><view class="picker-box">格式：{{formats[formatIndex]}}</view></picker>
    <view class="row option-row">
      <view>
        <view class="option-title">包含个人剂量备注</view>
        <view class="hint">默认关闭；开启后仅包含你有权查看的备注，并标注归属成员。</view>
      </view>
      <switch checked="{{includePersonalDosage}}" disabled="{{nativeActionPending}}" bindchange="onTogglePersonalDosage" />
    </view>
    <view class="row option-row">
      <view>
        <view class="option-title">包含已归档药品</view>
        <view class="hint">默认关闭；开启后归档药品以"（已归档）"分区输出。</view>
      </view>
      <switch checked="{{includeArchived}}" disabled="{{nativeActionPending}}" bindchange="onToggleArchived" />
    </view>
    <view class="row option-row">
      <view>
        <view class="option-title">包含存放位置</view>
        <view class="hint">默认开启；未记录的批次会标注"存放位置未记录"。</view>
      </view>
      <switch checked="{{includeStorageLocation}}" disabled="{{nativeActionPending}}" bindchange="onToggleStorageLocation" />
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="row">
      <view class="section-title">导出预览</view>
      <view class="hint" wx:if="{{generatedAt !== ''}}">{{generatedAt}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="hint" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在生成…</view>
    <textarea class="markdown-view" value="{{markdown}}" disabled maxlength="-1" />
  </view>

  <view class="hint" wx:if="{{actionBusy}}">正在处理导出，请稍候…</view>
  <view class="btn btn-primary" bindtap="onCopy">复制文本</view>
  <view class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="onShareFile">分享 {{formats[formatIndex]}} 文件</view>
  <view class="hint footnote" wx:if="{{lastAction !== ''}}">{{lastAction}}</view>
  <view class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="onRefreshSnapshot">重新生成最新快照</view>
  <view class="hint footnote">三个格式使用同一只读库存快照。分享不可用时复制文本；PDF 回退为同一快照的 Markdown。导出内容仅供家庭管理参考，以说明书和医嘱为准。</view>
</view>
